#     up at +4: it lands at +3 next frame), the leg that pushed trailing behind with its knee bent (-23 / -54, toe down).
#   Plants 3:-5, -5:-9, -9:-15 (holds 8 / 4 / 6 px, 36 px a cycle, STYLE_P2 10); the left views a pixel forward. Poses
