#   front leg landing flat at +4 on a bent knee, the trailing leg folded (knee bent at the boot top, toe-down boot lifted 2
#   behind); recover run2 / run5, the carrying leg under the hips (the knee proud), the swing knee DRIVEN UP IN FRONT (the
#   thigh forward, the shin hanging, its toe-down boot lifted 2 ahead of the carrying foot): never two upright legs side by
